# Example ReRDMFT input file: CASSCF on LiH (6-31G) with NON_REL, X2C and C4_SPINOR in one run.
# CASSCF follows the SCF/DHF: the core is the lowest NELEC - CASSCF_ELECTRONS spinors (here 2 electrons), the active space the
# next CASSCF_SPINORS spinors (4 spinors, 2 electrons); the CI uses all determinants of the active space (real for NON_REL,
# complex spinors for X2C/4C) and the orbitals are optimized with ADAM. USE_RI defaults to TRUE (RI integrals).
# The report ends with the total energy, h-onebody / Vee / N-N and the natural occupation numbers of the active space.
# It also writes RESTART.NON_REL / RESTART.X2C / RESTART.4C (orbitals + CI vector), see casscf_lih_read_restart.inp.
NELEC 4
BASIS lih-6-31g.gbs
NON_RELATIVISTIC TRUE
X2C TRUE
C4_SPINOR TRUE
CASSCF TRUE
CASSCF_ELECTRONS 2
CASSCF_SPINORS 4

GEOMETRY
Li  0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
H   0.000000   0.000000   1.594900
END
